    "User supplies lyrics; no new transcription text is inserted.",
    "Only an explicit alignment-button click starts the operation.",
    "Search each supplied phrase across the full recording and stereo channels before forced alignment.",
    "Resolve overlapping phrase variants and original ordering jointly.",
    "Verify weak passages locally; retain the original probability thresholds.",
